{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026eADbCWMGhH1792968185.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>短短一個星期內，再有新股決定延遲上市。</p><p></p><p>原定本周三掛牌的機械人公司微億智造宣布，經考慮多項因素，包括現行市況，決定延遲全球發售及擬於聯交所主板上市。申請股款將於本周三、即10月28日退還。</p><p></p><p>瘦西湖文旅於上周二才宣布延遲上市，理由同樣是考慮包括現行市況等多項因素決定。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:39.881688+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-25T22:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T14:58:43.193355+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T04:40:26.290741+00:00","content_hash":"025e371018ad3a98aefcb74fe998818ef4d03de4bb41e7daa1e43f1c3b623b90","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T04:46:39.881688+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}